§FACT menu0_desc="Read a building's grid: every grid line's id (gx0, gx1, … along x; gy0, gy1, … along y) and its position in metres in the building's own frame, plus the structural system, the material, the number of girders and the building's rotation in degrees. Opens a fresh copy of the building; takes about 10 to 40 seconds. Changes nothing."  <- scripts/film_neuro/evidence/tools_list.jsonl :: tools[0].description
