§FACT menu1_desc="Shift one grid line, and every later line on the same axis, by a distance in metres (positive = towards higher positions). Only the bay just before that line changes width; the rest of the building travels with it. The app makes the change, checks it (overlaps, beam spans against their limit, doors and windows against their walls) and returns its report: what changed, each check before and after, and what was not checked. If the change adds new problems the app undoes it and returns stopped_by_gate with the reason. Opens a fresh copy each time; nothing is saved."  <- scripts/film_neuro/evidence/tools_list.jsonl :: tools[1].description
